>1)  How do I get over the traps to enter the castle?  This is really getting
>annoying....<sigh>

You can either teleport if you have intrinsic teleport and a ring of teleport
control or you levitate over the traps. Levitation is achieved by (a) Ring of
Levitation, (b) Boots of Levitation, (c) Potion of Levitation.

